# CHANGELOG

## 20230924

0.5.1: Using the DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME as the default value for the profile_name argument doesn't seem to work, so assigning the default value in a separate line.

1. ~ Browser::Brave#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
2. ~ Browser::Brave#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
3. ~ Browser::Chrome#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
4. ~ Browser::Chrome#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
5. ~ Browser::Chromium#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
6. ~ Browser::Chromium#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
7. ~ Browser::Firefox#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
8. ~ Browser::Firefox#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
9. ~ Browser::Safari#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
10. ~ Browser::Safari#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
11. ~ Browser::TorBrowser#bookmarks_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/
12. ~ Browser::TorBrowser#history_location: /DEFAULT_PROFILE_NAME/nil/


## 20230923

